%% Source: SummarizerApp README system architecture.
graph LR
    accTitle: MeetSummarizer system overview
    accDescr: The Electron app connects to native or WebGPU speech transcription and an Express, Socket.io, and PostgreSQL backend.

    subgraph App["🖥️ Electron App"]
        Main["Main Process<br/>STT + Backend Lifecycle"]
        UI["React UI<br/>Meeting · Captions · Summary · Settings"]
        Main <-->|IPC| UI
    end

    subgraph STT["🧠 Local STT"]
        Native["Whisper.cpp<br/>Buffer → Preprocess → Transcribe"]
        WebGPU["WebGPU Whisper<br/>Fallback"]
    end

    subgraph Server["☁️ Backend"]
        API["Express REST"]
        Socket["Socket.io"]
        DB[("PostgreSQL")]
        API --> DB
        Socket --> DB
    end

    Main -->|spawn| Native
    Main -.->|fallback| WebGPU
    Native -->|transcript| Main
    WebGPU -->|captions| UI
    UI -->|HTTP| API
    UI <-->|WebSocket| Socket
